{"paperId":"28ec6450bc93","title":"河南省2019年统一考试录用司法所公务员《行测》题（网友回忆版）","region":"河南","year":2019,"module":"数量关系","materials":[],"questions":[{"qid":"2452800","seq":1,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"(    )，11，20，31，44，59","options":[{"key":"A","text":"2"},{"key":"B","text":"3"},{"key":"C","text":"4"},{"key":"D","text":"5"}],"answer":["C"],"analysisHtml":"<p>数列无明显特征，优先考虑<span style=\"color:#rgb(89,89,89)\">作</span>差。<span style=\"color:#rgb(89,89,89)\">作</span>差后得到新数列：（   ）、9、11、13、15，是公差为2 的等差数列，则第一项为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-e3974e0e929a5d5c.png\" />，故题干所求项为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-8aa3a97d6afe62fc.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为C。 </p>","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452807","seq":2,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"<p><img width=\"663px\" height=\"303px\" src=\"xingce/img/题目图/16ee9fcbb2b1f45.png\" /></p>","options":[{"key":"A","text":"-6"},{"key":"B","text":"-3"},{"key":"C","text":"-4"},{"key":"D","text":"-5"}],"answer":["A"],"analysisHtml":"<p>题干出现图形，且大数位置不固定，优先考虑凑相等。观察发现每一行或者每一列相加之和都为6，故所求项为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-c52123a0d21a90ed.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-d12f7de1b85f3d7d.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。 </p>","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452809","seq":3,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"108.02，-70.04，72.06，-34.08，36.10，（  ）","options":[{"key":"A","text":"-7.12"},{"key":"B","text":"7.02"},{"key":"C","text":"9.12"},{"key":"D","text":"-9.12"}],"answer":["A"],"analysisHtml":"原数列中数字均为小数，可将整数部分与小数部分分开观察。整数部分正负交替，数字分别108、70、72、34、36，作差加和均无规律，观察各项数字发现，各位数字相加之和为9、7、9、7、9，则下一项整数部分加和应为7。小数部分为02、04、06、08、10，构成公差为2的等差数列，下一项为12。因为原数列正负交替循环，则所求项应为-7.12。\n故正确答案为A。","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452814","seq":4,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-b2fd650604464704.png\" /></p>","options":[{"key":"A","text":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-27680b8ff34820b6.png\" /></p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-c36469aa3c1e2bbc.png\" /></p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-d4f41ca7bd6765c7.png\" /></p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-aa3afe2b6a3ee027.png\" /></p>"}],"answer":["A"],"analysisHtml":"<p>将原数列分子分母分开观察，分子均为1，分母为2、3、5、7、11、13，为质数列，下一项为17。则所求项为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-27680b8ff34820b6.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452816","seq":5,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"某市从市儿童公园到市科技馆有6种不同路线，从市科技馆到市少年宫有5种不同路线，从市儿童公园到市少年宫有4种不同路线，则从市儿童公园到市少年宫的路线共有：","options":[{"key":"A","text":"24种"},{"key":"B","text":"36种"},{"key":"C","text":"34种"},{"key":"D","text":"38种"}],"answer":["C"],"analysisHtml":"<p>从市儿童公园到市科技馆有6种不同路线，从市科技馆到市少年官有5种不同路线，那么从市儿童公园途径科技馆再到市少年宫有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-ac198a0660314ea2.png\" />种路线；从市儿童公园到市少年宫有4种不同路线。故从市儿童公园到市少年宫共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-dd52b906b7990200.png\" />种路线。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452818","seq":6,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"<p>在切钢管时会在切口处产生钢材损耗，每切一次损耗的钢材量约为10克，一根钢材被均匀地切成三等份，损耗钢材为钢材总重量的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-8693df358fd8d508.png\" />，则这根钢材的重量为：</p>","options":[{"key":"A","text":"10千克"},{"key":"B","text":"12千克"},{"key":"C","text":"14千克"},{"key":"D","text":"15千克"}],"answer":["A"],"analysisHtml":"<p>根据题意，一根钢材被切成三等份，需要切两次，则损耗的钢材量为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-5775b69ee7733b38.png\" />克。又因为损耗钢材为钢材总重量的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-8693df358fd8d508.png\" />，则钢材总重量为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-78c98dbe3c588d1f.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-cdddd9b18a992995.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-b6e9cc0b9d1fa06e.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452819","seq":7,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"小王从乡镇骑自行车前往县城，若他骑行速度为18千米/时，则下午5点钟到达；若他骑行速度为20千米/时，则下午4点钟到达。小王的出发时间为：","options":[{"key":"A","text":"早上6点"},{"key":"B","text":"早上7点"},{"key":"C","text":"早上8点"},{"key":"D","text":"中午12点"}],"answer":["B"],"analysisHtml":"<p>乡镇到县城的路程一定，则速度与时间成反比。速度之比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-581a2ef64db8fd69.png\" />，对应时间之比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-6cb1ca9e36307573.png\" />。相差的1份对应1小时。当速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-0c38a0a9c0354072.png\" />时，所用时间为10小时，下午5点钟到达，对应出发时间应为早上7点。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452821","seq":8,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"某隧道长1500米，有一列长150米的火车通过这条隧道，从车头进入隧道到完全通过隧道花费的时间为50秒，整列火车完全在隧道中的时间是：","options":[{"key":"A","text":"43.2秒"},{"key":"B","text":"40.9秒"},{"key":"C","text":"38.3秒"},{"key":"D","text":"37.5秒"}],"answer":["B"],"analysisHtml":"<p>本题为行程问题中的火车过桥问题。<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-5f375a730144fa6c.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-07d0cde5260a1a21.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-9d770296bb8976a4.png\" />，则火车的速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-dde690e1aff265b9.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-c4dc5719172e0728.png\" />。整列火车完全在隧道中的路程为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-9330b08c4831905b.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-73c9fed892257b22.png\" />，那么整列火车完全在隧道中的时间为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-c12b8e6909b35e44.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-31c04ed2b84d823d.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452822","seq":9,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"有A、B两个书架，A书架有50本书，B书架有70本书，要使A书架上的书本数是B书架的2倍，则从B书架上拿书放到A架上是：","options":[{"key":"A","text":"30本"},{"key":"B","text":"32本"},{"key":"C","text":"34本"},{"key":"D","text":"35本"}],"answer":["A"],"analysisHtml":"<p>设从B书架上拿<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />本书放到A架上，根据题意可建立方程：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-cff9534e19f1275a.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-8d140a459df4a9a6.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-a4456e17b3fde797.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452801","seq":10,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"某书法兴趣班有学员12人，其中男生5人，女生7人。从中随机选取2名学生参加书法比赛，则选到1名男生和1名女生的概率为：","options":[{"key":"A","text":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-fa31e8c4965c7485.png\" /></p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-3369a803bce88857.png\" /></p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-bd5a852bed8d652e.png\" /></p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-e5ae5c083c90b591.png\" /></p>"}],"answer":["D"],"analysisHtml":"<p>根据公式，概率=<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-c0cda0300ab0135d.png\" />。总情况为12名学员随机选2名，共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-73e9434f8d77c5b9.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-740fe2a8e4883202.png\" />种情况；满足要求的情况为5名男生中选1名有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-3de6686602281a78.png\" />种情况、7名女生中选1名有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-05e49ee494e5aeab.png\" />种情况，分步用乘法，共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-3de6686602281a78.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-4f95f34ef577bba4.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-05e49ee494e5aeab.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-26c99c44c1155856.png\" />种情况。则概率=<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-e5ae5c083c90b591.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452803","seq":11,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"有一条自西向东流向的河流，甲、乙两艘轮船分别从河流的上游和下游两点开始相对航行，在相遇于某地时，甲船航行的路程为乙船的2倍。已知乙船的速度为甲船的2倍，水流速度为1千米/分，则甲船的航行速度为：","options":[{"key":"A","text":"4千米/分"},{"key":"B","text":"3千米/分"},{"key":"C","text":"2千米/分"},{"key":"D","text":"1千米/分"}],"answer":["D"],"analysisHtml":"<p>设甲船航行速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-14e8104200bc6ccf.png\" />，则乙船航行速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-3f3836bdc50a6402.png\" />，航行时间为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-130fc643a02fe1ca.png\" />。根据<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-4689e3593002acb3.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-bd1cb2136e2ae09d.png\" />，结合题干条件中甲船航行的路程为乙船的2倍，列式可得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-6c8bf056a3c154b7.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-adcbb056a4b0b5ba.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-bbe38fb6de98f3bd.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p><p>备注：本题为争议题，根据对“航行速度”的不同理解可以得出两个答案。若认为“航行速度”为船速，则本题选择D项；若认为“航行速度”包含水流速度对船速的影响，则本题甲船的航行速度应为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-62f6e8f6f013005b.png\" />千米/分，选择C项。粉笔倾向正确答案为D项。</p>","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452806","seq":12,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"一瓶硫酸使用了5天，使用时后一天总比前一天少使用1毫升，今天做实验用掉了5毫升后，现在剩下的量与已经用掉的量相同，则这瓶硫酸原来有：","options":[{"key":"A","text":"70毫升"},{"key":"B","text":"65毫升"},{"key":"C","text":"60毫升"},{"key":"D","text":"55毫升"}],"answer":["A"],"analysisHtml":"<p>根据“使用时后一天总比前一天少使用1毫升”可得，这5天硫酸用量为等差数列。等差数列求和公式<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-f464dafb028fdbf8.png\" />，第3天使用硫酸量为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-54da92d033bdf1ad.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-efcb26cb81daf51e.png\" />，则5天使用硫酸总量为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-0f0326e0cb7b8367.png\" />。根据“剩下的量与已经用掉的量相同”可得，这瓶硫酸原来有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-60a9d97d0aa68819.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452808","seq":13,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"把1到82这82个自然数都相加起来，但由于中间有两个连续的数都多加了一次，得到的和为3520，则多加的第一个数是：","options":[{"key":"A","text":"55"},{"key":"B","text":"57"},{"key":"C","text":"58"},{"key":"D","text":"60"}],"answer":["C"],"analysisHtml":"<p>设多加的第一个数是<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />，根据等差数列求和公式<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-5be545c31c55e854.png\" />可得，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-b01b1d15e1532af6.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-deca6159656153b0.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-ffd74075f46c76c7.png\" />，整理得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-ef2a23310f9dfbe0.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-cab7dbae65c94253.png\" />，选项尾数不同考虑尾数法，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-1160ffc37a9b6750.png\" />尾数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-d47a91a99e68df2d.png\" />，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />尾数为3或8，只有C项满足。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>","materialId":null},{"qid":"2452811","seq":14,"type":"数学运算","kind":"single","stemHtml":"有8个不同颜色的小球，从中任意选出3个分给3个学生，每人1个，则其分法有：","options":[{"key":"A","text":"72种"},{"key":"B","text":"216种"},{"key":"C","text":"336种"},{"key":"D","text":"1008种"}],"answer":["C"],"analysisHtml":"<p>从8个球中任选3个球，有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-8ff5f6a08f06943d.png\" />种情况；将3个球分给3个学生，有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-bf56534b1b5b9790.png\" />种情况。分步用乘法，则共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-8ff5f6a08f06943d.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-4f95f34ef577bba4.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-bf56534b1b5b9790.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-b8394652bd4fc6be.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-4557300a28d71c33.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"xingce/img/公式图/formula-3ff98aa97c0ba41b.png\" />种情况。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>","materialId":null}]}